abstract: >
  _codex_ is an ML training, evaluation, plugin, and repository-automation
  framework. The repository contains PyTorch, Hugging Face Transformers, Hydra,
  MLflow, LoRA/QLoRA, Ray, model-serving, and dependency-light standalone
  contract surfaces; availability varies by installation profile and optional
  dependencies.
